('The 2026 Roth IRA limit is $7,500 under 50 or $8,600 over 50; contributions can be withdrawn anytime, growth is locked until 59 1/2.','In 2026, the limit is $7,500','IRA2026: verified; IRS raised the 2026 IRA limit to $7,500 with a $1,100 indexed catch-up ($8,600 at 50+). Withdrawal description is broadly correct but omits the five-year rule and exceptions.',['IRA2026']),
